# Munisible Task Force - Soulbound Credentials (SBT)

ERC-5192 compliant Soulbound Token (SBT) framework for issuing non-transferable proof-of-achievement badges across Munisible Task Force and Family First programs.

## 🏅 Core Credentials
* **Family Guardian:** Issued for preserving family integrity and providing mentorship.
* **Self-Mastery Tier 1-3:** Awarded upon completing key personal growth milestones.
* **Task Force Leader:** Granted to verified local community leaders and mission heads.

## 🛠 Quick Start
```bash
npm install
npm run compile
npm run test
